+ * Token format (`DG1.<header>.<payload>.<signature>`, base64url parts):
+ *   header    = { kind, suite, kid, pk }   kid = SHA-256 fingerprint of pk
+ *   payload   = canonical JSON of the receipt / voucher
+ *   signature = sign(privateKey, payload, context = DOCUMENT_KINDS[kind].context)
